// Demonstrates: an "action"/"set" command appearing after a node's reply options — not allowed
// there (only "if"/"random" may still appear after replies, since they can wrap further reply
// options). Two instances, to prove resync reports each separately rather than merging or
// dropping one.
title: Start
speaker: Narrator
---
[[Continue.|Start]]
<<set $x = 1>>
<<sett $y = 2>>
===
